        <mxCell id="erd_master_trainer_note" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;arcSize=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Catatan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Sumber: input/Master - Buat Program/2026-10-29-master-trainer/ (format &lt;i&gt;Master Trainer Ivan Sarifudin.xlsx&lt;/i&gt;, 5 sheet).&lt;br&gt;• Kolom audit &lt;i&gt;created_by, created_date, updated_by, updated_date&lt;/i&gt; ada di setiap tabel, tidak digambar (pola &amp; tabel &lt;i&gt;logs&lt;/i&gt; di halaman ERD Activity Log).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;ms_trainer&lt;/i&gt; tanpa hapus, hanya &lt;i&gt;aktif&lt;/i&gt; 1/0 (FR-46).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;bidang_keahlian&lt;/i&gt;: satu bidang per baris (usulan).&lt;br&gt;• Empat tabel riwayat = sheet Excel; &lt;i&gt;urutan&lt;/i&gt; = kolom No.; disimpan ulang (hapus + insert) saat trainer disimpan.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;ms_trainer_lampiran.file_path&lt;/i&gt; opsional (Q-27).&lt;br&gt;• Dipakai &lt;i&gt;penjualan_program.id_trainer&lt;/i&gt; (halaman ERD Penjualan Program)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1068" y="60" width="420" height="330" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
