        <mxCell id="erd_quotation_rel_qtn_qps" edge="1" parent="1" source="erd_quotation_quotation_id" target="erd_quotation_quotation_peserta_id_quotation" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;endFill=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="990" y="143.0" /><mxPoint x="990" y="1187.0" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="erd_quotation_rel_qtn_qket" edge="1" parent="1" source="erd_quotation_quotation_id" target="erd_quotation_quotation_keterangan_id_quotation" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;endFill=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1020" y="143.0" /><mxPoint x="1020" y="2029.0" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="erd_quotation_rel_qtn_so" edge="1" parent="1" source="erd_quotation_quotation_id" target="erd_quotation_sales_order_id_quotation" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endArrow=ERzeroToOne;endFill=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1050" y="143.0" /><mxPoint x="1050" y="2285.0" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="erd_quotation_note" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;arcSize=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Kontrak Quotation fase 3–5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Audit created_by/created_date/updated_by/updated_date tidak digambar. Aktor login = users.id_user; konfirmasi publik created_by NULL dan payload actor_type=publik. tr_penawaran lama tidak dipakai.&lt;br&gt;• Public &amp;amp; B2B Final → quotation. Public banyak quotation; B2B satu selain Batal (diperiksa server). id_sales → ms_user_karyawan.id.&lt;br&gt;• Harga peserta disalin dari penjualan saat simpan. Public: diskon Rupiah per peserta. B2B selalu allin: paket s.d. 25, tambahan Rp300.000/orang di atas 25; diskon hanya paket. Batas paket/tarif disalin. DPP/PPN mencakup tambahan (USULAN berlaku sementara).&lt;br&gt;• Sebelum Deal, perhitungan memakai kuota; setelah Deal memakai jumlah Deal. B2B kuota dan jumlah Deal minimal 10. Public personal kuota 1, kepada_nama wajib; company boleh menambah kuota saat Terkirim.&lt;br&gt;• Link acak satu/quotation dibuat saat simpan. Draft/Terkirim menerima isian sampai H-14 inklusif dan masa berlaku, kuota Public belum penuh, B2B PIC belum kirim. Closed/Deal/Batal menutup isian. Token tidak masuk audit/props umum.&lt;br&gt;• Peserta diisi lewat link (manual tidak tersedia fase 3). B2B daftar PIC: sumber company, snapshot company di quotation_konfirmasi_company, UNIQUE(id_quotation,revisi). Public sumber link. Kolom nullable mempertahankan data lama; aplikasi mewajibkan nama dan waktu isian baru.&lt;br&gt;• Saat Deal: cocokkan NIK → email → WA; konflik/ambigu ditolak, hanya lengkapi master kosong. Data isian quotation tetap historis. id_peserta terisi saat Deal. UNIQUE lama (id_quotation,id_peserta) dihapus; index id_quotation tetap.&lt;br&gt;• Deal atomik membuat satu SO/quotation (UK id_quotation), dokumen customer, Master Peserta, serta Surat Tugas pertama/program. SO status open; UI/cetak SO dan Surat Tugas di fase 4. ST.snapshot LONGTEXT NULL menyimpan program, judul/katalog, trainer, asisten, company dan sertifikat; tanpa honor. Surat lama tanpa snapshot memerlukan rekonsiliasi, tidak diisi otomatis.&lt;br&gt;• Surat Tugas: id_penjualan tidak UNIQUE; program_berlaku = CASE WHEN status = berlaku THEN id_penjualan ELSE NULL END (STORED, UNIQUE uk_skt_program_berlaku). Satu berlaku/program, surat diganti tetap historis. Trainer/asisten disalin dari program.&lt;br&gt;• Tabel dokumen/surat memiliki path privat, nama asli, batas 5 MB. Penggantian surat menyimpan berkas lama di quotation_peserta_surat_riwayat. quotation_keterangan menyimpan salinan teks terpilih, klausul cetak sesuai master.&lt;br&gt;• Fase 4: SO Siap/Invoice; fase 5: reschedule, konfirmasi ulang, Refund, revisi -rev{n}, peserta keluar dan Invoice belum lunas Batal. Sertifikat/Close mengikuti catatan fase 6 di bawah. Riwayat cetak disimpan quotation_revisi, lihat halaman ERD Revisi Quotation." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1198.0" y="60" width="440" height="660" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="erd_quotation_qdok" parent="1" style="shape=table;startSize=30;container=1;collapsible=1;childLayout=tableLayout;fixedRows=1;rowLines=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;resizeLast=1;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" value="quotation_dokumen" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1228.0" y="760" width="364" height="186" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="erd_quotation_qdok_id" parent="erd_quotation_qdok" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;fillColor=none;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;top=0;left=0;right=0;bottom=1;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry y="30" width="364" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
