        <mxCell id="erd_quotation_rf_selesai_date_t" parent="erd_quotation_rf_selesai_date" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" value="DATETIME NULL" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="214" width="150" height="26" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="150" height="26" as="alternateBounds" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="erd_quotation_rf_txt" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Fase 5 — Refund terpisah&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• UNIQUE(id_invoice,kunci_penerima); kunci server company atau peserta:ID. FK fisik id_invoice → invoice.id, id_konfirmasi_ulang → quotation_peserta_konfirmasi_ulang.id, id_sales_order → sales_order.id.&lt;br&gt;• Maksimum dana dari piutang Invoice lunas historis; alokasi nominal peserta largest remainder, tie ID naik, bobot sama bila penjualan nol. Nilai/snapshot historis tidak ditulis ulang.&lt;br&gt;• Finance permission sales_order_refund View/Manage, tanpa approval/grant otomatis. Transfer dan pembalikan jurnal manual. Rekening/bukti hanya detail berizin; audit dimasking.&lt;br&gt;• selesai_by dan empat kolom audit → users.id_user. Tidak menambah jurnal kas otomatis." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1228.0" y="3300" width="364" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
